          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko aca anyinjiza imbere mu rugo rw’Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Mu rwinjiriro rwayo, hagati y’umuryango n’igicaniro c’umwakaka, hari abagabo mirongo ibiri na batanu. Bari bateye umugongo urusengero, baraba mu buseruko, bunamira izuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambaza ati: “Ivyo wabibonye ga mwana w’umuntu? Mbega ab’inzu ya Yuda bibaza ko gukorera ibizira nk’ibi ngaha ari ibintu bisanzwe? Igihugu cabo bakacuzuzamwo umuryano, bagatuma mbandanya nuzura uburake? Ehe raba ingene bashira inengo ku zuru ngo bandatse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma nanje nzobarakira; sinzobarabana ijisho ry’imbabazi, kandi nta n’umwe ntazoshikira. Naho bazontakambira mu matwi n’ijwi rirenga, sinzobumva.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
